  "aiContextParagraph": "Following the death of 17-year-old Silva Nur Intania Putri, a student at SMAN 7 Malang, authorities confirmed that four minors involved in the assault have been taken into custody at the Malang Women's Penitentiary. The incident has drawn significant attention from national institutions, with the Ministry of Women's Empowerment and Child Protection and the Indonesian Ombudsman calling for a rigorous investigation and enhanced school oversight. In the aftermath of the event, unrest occurred at a residential area in Pakis, Malang, where a crowd damaged security infrastructure while attempting to locate the residence of one of the suspects. Government officials, including the Minister of Women's Empowerment and Child Protection, have visited the victim's family to offer support. Local police and government agencies emphasize that the legal proceedings against the suspects will continue in accordance with the law despite their status as minors.",
